00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Cheesy Cauliflower Bake with Smoked Chicken. 45 min · 6 servings · American

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ingredients: 10. 1 head of cauliflower; 2 cups shredded cheddar or pepper jack cheese; 4 oz cream cheese, softened (room temp); 1/4 cup sour cream

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
