4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 2. After cauliflower is done, drain if needed, and sprinkle with the oregano, parsley, salt, and pepper.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Step 3. Add to the cheese mixture and stir until all is well coated and incorporated. Here is where I add the cooked smoked chicken and toss to coat.

6
